            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70204468?u=ba210acb785f90a2dda51de86e526f162069b6ad&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR replaces cyrillic script with mongolian script to <span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43515.\">fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4114909905\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43515\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43515/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43515\">#43515</a> . It also replaces attribute selector with <code class=\"notranslate\">:lang</code> pseudo selector, which matches elements more accurately.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4114909905\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43515\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43515/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43515\">#43515</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43515.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4114909905\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43515\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43515/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43515\">#43515</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
